{% doc %}
  Renders one outline feature icon by name. Paths are Lucide icons (lucide-static 1.66.0), drawn at stroke 1 on a 24 px box per DESIGN.md.

  @param {string} name - Icon name, one of the `line_icon` select values
  @param {string} [class] - Extra class on the svg
{% enddoc %}
